sequenceDiagram
    participant Customer
    participant Frontend
    participant API
    participant Firestore
    participant Stripe
    participant Webhook
    
    Customer->>Frontend: Complete booking form
    Frontend->>API: Create checkout session
    API->>Firestore: Create pending booking<br/>(status: pending_payment)
    
    API->>Stripe: Create Checkout Session<br/>(metadata: bookingId)
    Stripe-->>API: Return session URL
    API-->>Frontend: Redirect URL
    
    Frontend->>Customer: Redirect to Stripe
    Customer->>Stripe: Enter payment details
    Stripe->>Stripe: Process payment
    
    alt Payment Successful
        Stripe->>Webhook: checkout.session.completed
        Webhook->>Firestore: Update booking<br/>(status: confirmed)
        Webhook->>Firestore: Update customer<br/>(stripeCustomerId)
        Webhook->>Frontend: Send FCM notification
        Frontend->>Customer: Show confirmation
    else Payment Failed
        Stripe->>Webhook: checkout.session.expired
        Webhook->>Firestore: Update booking<br/>(status: cancelled)
        Frontend->>Customer: Show error
    end
